# UI Kit project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/ui-kit-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/ui-kit-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

- `ui-kit/package/` — `@webonone/ui-kit` library (tsup)
- `ui-kit/showcase/` — demo app, port **3002**

Spec: [spec/1.0.0/05-ui-kit-project.md](../../spec/1.0.0/05-ui-kit-project.md)

## Workflow

1. Change components in `ui-kit/package/src/`.
2. Export public API from `ui-kit/package/src/index.ts`.
3. Preview in showcase.
4. Build: `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit`.

## Consumers

| Project | Usage |
|---------|---------|
| `identity/frontend` | Auth forms, AuthLayout |
| `webonone-v2/frontend` | PageShell, layouts — not login forms |

Do not copy kit components into consumer apps.

## Verification

```bash
npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit
npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root
```

No business logic, auth, or service backends in this project.
